                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to General Chaffee.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Received by General Chaffee, Toitsun,
                        August 8, 1900.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-04"><hi rendition="#italic">August 4,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Situation more critical, but we will hold on until your arrival; hope it will be
                    soon. Send such information as you can.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
